      "extract": "THE SUM-PRODUCT CONJECTURE IS FALSE FOR REAL NUMBERS THOMAS F. BLOOM, WILL SAWIN, CARL SCHILDKRAUT, AND DMITRII ZHELEZOV Abstract. We disprove the sum-product conjecture for real numbers by con- structing arbitrarily large A ⊂R (whose elements are algebraic integers in a number field of degree ≍log|A|) such that max(|A + A| , |AA|) ≤|A|2−c where c > 0 is an absolute constant. We also disprove the many sums and",
